          "text": "Associated symptoms and pertinent negatives with left lower leg pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient denies numbness, weakness, colour change, fevers, trauma, redness, or wounds."
      }
    },
